      <VERS vnumber="8">Who <gr str="732">goeth </gr>in <gr str="2274">company </gr>with the <gr str="6466">workers </gr>of <gr str="205">iniquity</gr>, and <gr str="3212">walketh </gr>with <gr str="7562">wicked </gr>
        <gr str="582">men</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="9">For he hath <gr str="559">said</gr>, It <gr str="5532">profiteth </gr>a <gr str="1397">man </gr>nothing that he should <gr str="7521">delight </gr>himself with <gr str="430">God</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="10">Therefore <gr str="8085">hearken </gr>to me, ye <gr str="582">men </gr>of <gr str="3824">understanding</gr>: far be <gr str="2486">it </gr>from <gr str="410">God</gr>, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">that he should do </STYLE>
