      <VERS vnumber="11">For the <gr str="6467">work </gr>of a <gr str="120">man </gr>he shall <gr str="7999">render </gr>to him, and cause every <gr str="376">man </gr>to <gr str="4672">find </gr>according to <STYLE css="font-style:italic">his </STYLE>
