      <VERS vnumber="13">Who hath given him a <gr str="6485">charge </gr>over the <gr str="776">earth</gr>? or who hath <gr str="7760">disposed </gr>the whole <gr str="8398">world</gr>? <DIV>
          <NOTE type="x-studynote">the whole: Heb. all of it?</NOTE>
