      <VERS vnumber="14">If he should <gr str="7760">set </gr>his <gr str="3820">heart </gr>upon man, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">if</STYLE> he should <gr str="622">gather </gr>to himself his <gr str="7307">spirit </gr>and his <gr str="5397">breath</gr>; <DIV>
