      <VERS vnumber="15">All <gr str="1320">flesh </gr>would <gr str="1478">perish </gr>
        <gr str="3162">together</gr>, and <gr str="120">man </gr>would turn <gr str="7725">again </gr>to <gr str="6083">dust</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="16">If now <STYLE css="font-style:italic">thou hast </STYLE>
