      <VERS vnumber="20">In a <gr str="7281">moment </gr>they shall <gr str="4191">die</gr>, and the <gr str="5971">people </gr>shall be <gr str="1607">troubled </gr>at <gr str="2676 3915">midnight</gr>, and pass <gr str="5674">away</gr>: and the <gr str="47">mighty </gr>shall be taken <gr str="5493">away </gr>without <gr str="3027">hand</gr>. <DIV>
          <NOTE type="x-studynote">the mighty…: Heb. they shall take away the mighty</NOTE>
