      <VERS vnumber="23">For he will not <gr str="7760">lay </gr>upon <gr str="376">man </gr>more <STYLE css="font-style:italic">than right</STYLE>; that he should <gr str="1980">enter </gr>into <gr str="4941">judgment </gr>with <gr str="410">God</gr>. <DIV>
