        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="24">He shall break in <gr str="7489">pieces </gr>mighty <gr str="3524">men </gr>without <gr str="2714">number</gr>, and <gr str="5975">set </gr>
        <gr str="312">others </gr>in their stead. <DIV>
