      <VERS vnumber="28">So that they cause the <gr str="6818">cry </gr>of the <gr str="1800">poor </gr>to <gr str="935">come </gr>to him, and he <gr str="8085">heareth </gr>the <gr str="6818">cry </gr>of the <gr str="6041">afflicted</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="29">When he giveth <gr str="8252">quietness</gr>, who then can make <gr str="7561">trouble</gr>? and when he <gr str="5641">hideth </gr>
