        <gr str="3162">only</gr>:</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="30">That the <gr str="120 2611">hypocrite </gr>may not <gr str="4427">reign</gr>, lest the <gr str="5971">people </gr>should be <gr str="4170">ensnared</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="31">Surely hast <STYLE css="font-style:italic">any one </STYLE>
